{
  "_note": "v0.45.0 (plan v0.45.0-steps-timeline QĐ T1–T10, G3, M4) SSR contract timeline@1 (ADR 0012): td_timeline() ALWAYS prints <td-timeline data-td-ssr=\"timeline@1\" time-zone=\"…\"> + the exact tree <td-timeline> builds, hydrated IN PLACE (day labels recomputed as text). The fixture script sets date_default_timezone_set('UTC') (the fallback zone). Shared by test/php/td-ssr-steps-timeline.test.js and src/display/td-timeline.ssr.engines.browser-test.js (via test/ssr/fixtures/timeline.html — GENERATED by `node test/ssr/build-steps-timeline-fixture.mjs`). expect.groups = [data-day, label printed by PHP, ids]; expect.tz = the printed time-zone; `now` (the fixture's) is also set early on the browser host so the recomputed labels stay equal.",
